    {
      "sourceId": "src-969ca4e0b66c5816",
      "quote": "The Experimental Syntax Lab , directed by Grant Goodall, does research on the syntax of natural language using experimental techniques. We have a special interest in sentence acceptability experiments, but our work is also informed by traditional methods of linguistic research (e.g., fieldwork, introspective judgments) and by psycholinguistic and computational methods (e.g., self-paced reading, corpus studies).",
      "supports": [
        "research",
        "topics",
